published paclet except for the definition notebook.\n\nCells can be toggled \
as excluded using ", 
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"Tools", 
                RowBox[{" ", "\[FilledRightTriangle]", " "}], "Cells", 
                RowBox[{" ", "\[FilledRightTriangle]", " "}], 
